# Root .env.example — see sub-folder examples for actual variables:
#
#   server/.env.example  ← copy to server/.env and fill in values
#   client/.env.example  ← copy to client/.env for production deploys
#
# Quick start:
#   copy server\.env.example server\.env
#   Then edit server\.env with your Postgres, Redis, JWT, and Cloudinary values.
